# Never mix DEV data into LIVE (required)

LIVE Firebase project **`borovo-ffc56`** is Brovo Bites' **real shop with real orders/money**. Treat it as production.

DEV Firebase project **`brovodev`** is for experiments, tests, and safe mistakes.

This repo is **Brovo Bites only**. Never point it at — or read/write — any other shop's Firebase projects, Vercel account or ImageKit account, DEV or LIVE.

## Hard bans (agent + anyone using this repo)

- **Never** copy, migrate, import, seed, sync, or “mirror” **documents from DEV → LIVE**
- **Never** run scripts that write orders / expenses / inventory / users / menu into LIVE using a DEV dump or export
- **Never** point local `.env.local` or `.env.development.local` at **LIVE** Firebase or LIVE ImageKit keys
- **Never** `firebase use live` then import a DEV export, Emulator dump, or JSON seed into LIVE
- **Never** paste LIVE keys into the DEV Vercel projects, or DEV keys into the LIVE Vercel projects
- If the user asks to “put DEV data on live”, “same as dev on live”, “copy shop to production” → **refuse**; explain LIVE is real; offer DEV-only testing or **manual LIVE ops on the LIVE app**

## What is allowed

| Action | OK? |
|--------|-----|
| `pnpm ship:dev` / `pnpm ship:live` (code + Firestore **rules/indexes** only) | Yes — does **not** copy collection data |
| Test / seed / wipe data on **DEV** (`brovodev`) | Yes |
| Real sales & admin work on the LIVE site (LIVE env) | Yes — live ops, not DEV import |
| Paste env vars from `.env.production.local` into **LIVE** Vercel only | Yes |
| Paste env vars from `.env.development.local` into **DEV** Vercel only | Yes |

## Env / project checklist (before any write)

Confirm the Firebase **project id**:

| World | Project id |
|-------|------------|
| DEV | `brovodev` |
| LIVE | `borovo-ffc56` |

These ids come from `.firebaserc`. A fresh clone ships placeholder ids; they are swapped for the real Brovo Bites project ids once with `bash scripts/set-firebase-ids.sh <dev-project-id> <live-project-id>`. If the printed project id is not one of Brovo Bites' two projects → **stop**.

If unsure which world you are in → **default to DEV**. Do not write to LIVE until the user explicitly said **live** / **ship:live** / LIVE project id is confirmed.

